    answer: '<p>Tax obligations don\'t change because of where you bank:</p><ul><li>You\'re taxed based on residency, not account location</li><li>Report all worldwide income regardless of currency</li><li>US citizens: FBAR filing required if foreign accounts exceed $10,000</li><li>Convert income to your tax reporting currency using appropriate rates</li></ul><p>See our <a href="/blog/tax-tips-remote-workers">tax tips for remote workers</a> for detailed guidance.</p>'
  },
  {
