    question: 'Can I hold cryptocurrency in these accounts?',
    answer: '<p>Some platforms offer crypto features:</p><ul><li><strong>Revolut:</strong> Buy, hold, and sell crypto within the app</li><li><strong>PayPal:</strong> Crypto trading available in some countries</li><li><strong>Wise & Payoneer:</strong> No crypto support</li></ul><p>For serious crypto use, dedicated exchanges (Coinbase, Kraken) typically offer better rates and features.</p>'
  },
