    question: 'How do I choose between these services?',
    answer: '<p>Match the service to your needs:</p><ul><li><strong>Receiving client payments:</strong> Wise or Payoneer</li><li><strong>Everyday spending:</strong> Revolut or N26</li><li><strong>Best exchange rates:</strong> Wise</li><li><strong>Most currencies:</strong> Wise (50+) or Revolut (30+)</li><li><strong>US-based:</strong> Wise or Payoneer (Revolut/N26 have limited US service)</li></ul><p>Many nomads use multiple services for different purposes.</p>'
